{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天帝姓憍尸迦，名釋提桓因，此云能天主，俗稱玉帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿素洛即阿修羅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即除糞担屍賤類人也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殺人家。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "農人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、布施，二、持戒，三、忍辱，四、精進，五、禪定，六、般若。"}
